        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Loneliness and Irrational Beliefs</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 100%;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 708px;\n    margin: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .main {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 2px;\n    left: 13px;\n    width: 416px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n\n  .main p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .line {\n    display: block;\n    height: 18px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .zh {\n    font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", sans-serif;\n    text-decoration-line: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #888;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .sidebar {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 100px;\n    height: 708px;\n    padding: 3px 1px 0 2px;\n    border-left: 2px solid #c5c5c5;\n    background: #f6f8f1;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 21.15px;\n  }\n\n  .side-line {\n    display: block;\n    height: 21.15px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  mark {\n    padding: 0;\n    color: inherit;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n\n  .peach {\n    background: #f3d79f;\n    text-decoration-line: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #8b7449;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .green {\n    background: #b7dcae;\n    text-decoration-line: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #557354;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .pink {\n    background: #efb6b8;\n    text-decoration-line: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #80585a;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <main class=\"main\">\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">此外，社会、教育和文化促使<mark class=\"green\">强化</mark>某些关于孤独的<mark class=\"peach\">非理性</mark>信</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">念。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">Society has a <mark class=\"peach\">tendency</mark> to think that if someone is 40 years</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">old and living alone, there's something wrong.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">社会有一种<mark class=\"peach\">倾向</mark>，如果一个人40岁了，仍在独自生活，那就有</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">问题了。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">However, it should be realized that the central problem tends</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">to be the belief <mark class=\"green\">surrounding</mark> it.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">然而，应该认识到，核心问题往往是<mark class=\"green\">围绕</mark>它的信念。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">In other words, the problem isn't loneliness itself, it's what's</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">said about it, how it's <mark class=\"peach\">interpreted</mark>, and the meaning it's</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">given.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">换句话说，问题不在于孤独本身，而在于人们对它说了什么、</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">如何解释它，以及它被赋予的意义。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">Today, we live in crowded places and are <mark class=\"peach\">incredibly</mark></span>\n      <span class=\"line\">connected to each other, thanks to social media.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">如今，多亏了社交媒体，我们生活在拥挤的地方，彼此之间有</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">着<mark class=\"peach\">难以置信的联系</mark>。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">Nevertheless, it may be that this isn't enough for you, and</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">you feel alone because you're single or live <mark class=\"peach\">completely</mark></span>\n      <span class=\"line\"><mark class=\"peach\">alone</mark>.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">然而，这对你来说可能还不够，你会感到孤独，因为你单身或</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">者<mark class=\"peach\">完全独居</mark>。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">However, as we <mark class=\"peach\">mentioned</mark> earlier, that isn't the problem.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">然而，正如我们之前<mark class=\"peach\">提到的</mark>，这不是问题。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">It's your way of seeing it and the <mark class=\"peach\">dialogue</mark> you're having with</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">yourself about it that is the issue.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">问题在于你看待它的方式和你与自己的<mark class=\"peach\">对话</mark>。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">That's what makes you feel anxious, <mark class=\"peach\">depressed</mark>, and empty</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">inside.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">这就是让你感到<mark class=\"peach\">焦虑、沮丧和内心空虚的原因</mark>。</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"line\">Obviously, if you tell yourself a hundred times a day or more</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">that being alone is a terrible thing, that nobody loves you, and</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">you'll <mark class=\"green\">end up</mark> dying alone, your emotions will be extremely</span>\n      <span class=\"line\"><mark class=\"peach\">intense</mark> and you'll feel <mark class=\"peach\">dreadful</mark> because of these ideas and</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">thoughts that don't even <mark class=\"green\">correspond</mark> with reality.</span>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"zh\">\n      <span class=\"line\">显然，如果你每天告诉自己<mark class=\"green\">一百次或更多次</mark>，孤独是一件可怕</span>\n    </p>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"peach\">irrational</mark>:</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">adj.非理性</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">的，不合理</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">的，荒谬的</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">同义词：</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"green\">unreasonable</mark></span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"peach\">surround</mark>: v.</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">环绕，围绕</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"peach\">interpret</mark>:v.</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">诠释；说明</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"peach\">incredibly</mark>:ad</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">v.</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">极端地，非常</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">地</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"peach\">completely</mark>:</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">adv.彻底地；</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">完全地；完整</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">地</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"pink\">alone</mark>:adv.单</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">独，独自；</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"green\">go it alone</mark>:</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">独力；独自</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">干；单干</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"pink\">loneliness</mark>:n.</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">孤独；寂寞</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"pink\">lonely</mark>:adj.</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"green\">lonely life /</mark></span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"green\">existence</mark></span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"peach\">end up</mark> :最</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">终；结果；</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\"><mark class=\"peach\">correspond</mark>:</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">V.符合; 相</span>\n    <span class=\"side-line\">致;通信</span>\n  </aside>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
